="00:21.760">on </span><span begin="00:21.760" end="00:22.300">a </span><span begin="00:22.300" end="00:23.380">plane</span><span begin="00:23.380" end="00:23.410">, </span><span begin="00:23.410" end="00:24.220">from </span><span begin="00:24.220" end="00:24.760">London </span><span begin="00:24.760" end="00:26.110">Heathrow</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.410" end="00:31.000"><span begin="00:26.410" end="00:26.560">It </span><span begin="00:26.560" end="00:27.010">seems </span><span begin="00:27.010" end="00:27.880">such </span><span begin="00:27.880" end="00:27.940">a </span><span begin="00:27.940" end="00:29.770">shame</span><span begin="00:29.770" end="00:29.950">. </span><span begin="00:29.950" end="00:31.000">Yeah</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.420" end="00:32.860"><span begin="00:31.420" end="00:31.660">I </span><span begin="00:31.660" end="00:32.200">feel </span><span begin="00:32.200" end="00:32.860">her</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.890" end="00:37.090"><span begin="00:32.890" end="00:34.150">Slipping </span><span begin="00:34.150" end="00:34.900">through </span><span begin="00:34.900" end="00:35.500">my </span><span begin="00:35.500" end="00:37.090">fingers</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.180" end="00:43.840"><span begin="00:37.180" end="00:37.540">Now </span><span begin="00:37.540" end="00:38.350">she's </span><span begin="00:38.350" end="00:39.430">gone</span><span begin="00:39.430" end="00:39.700">, </span><span begin="00:39.700" end="00:39.940">I'm </span><span begin="00:39.940" end="00:40.750">sleeping </span><span begin="00:40.750" end="00:41.140">with </span><span begin="00:41.140" end="00:41.230">the </span><span begin="00:41.230" end="00:41.920">light </span><span begin="00:41.920" end="00:43.510">on</span><span begin="00:43.510" end="00:43.840">.</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.840" end="00:48.250"><span begin="00:43.840" end="00:44.080">And </span><span begin="00:44.080" end="00:44.470">sharks </