:04.330" end="01:05.050">ends</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.200" end="01:07.900"><span begin="01:05.200" end="01:05.470">And </span><span begin="01:05.470" end="01:05.530">I </span><span begin="01:05.530" end="01:05.920">feel </span><span begin="01:05.920" end="01:06.040">the </span><span begin="01:06.040" end="01:07.900">pain</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.930" end="01:10.570"><span begin="01:07.930" end="01:08.410">Cause </span><span begin="01:08.410" end="01:08.680">I'm </span><span begin="01:08.680" end="01:09.370">without </span><span begin="01:09.370" end="01:10.570">her</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.720" end="01:15.550"><span begin="01:10.720" end="01:10.990">I </span><span begin="01:10.990" end="01:11.470">feel </span><span begin="01:11.470" end="01:11.590">the </span><span begin="01:11.590" end="01:15.550">paaaaaaaaaiiiiiiin</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.550" end="01:16.990"><span begin="01:15.550" end="01:15.790">I </span><span begin="01:15.790" end="01:16.240">feel </span><span begin="01:16.240" end="01:16.990">her</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.020" end="01:21.250"><span begin="01:17.020" end="01:18.280">Slipping </span><span begin="01:18.280" end="01:19.000">through </span><span begin="01:19.000" end="01:19.630">my </span><span begin="01:19.630" end="01:21.250">fingers</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.310" end="01:28.000"><span begin="01:21.310" end="01:21.670">Now </span><span begin="01:21.670" end="01:22.480">she's </span><span begin="01:22.480" end="01:23.560">gone</span><span begin="01:23.560" end="01:23.830">, </span><span begin="01:23.830" end="01:24.070">I'm </span><span begin="01:24.070" end="01:24.880">sleeping </span><span begin="01:24.880" end="01:25.270">with </span><span begin="01:25.270" end="01:25.360">the </span><span begin="01:25.360" end="01:26.020">light </span><span begin="01:26.020" end="01:27.760">on</span><span begin="01:27.760" end="01:28.000">.</span></p><p ttm:agent="