" end="01:50.080">I've </span><span begin="01:50.080" end="01:50.320">been </span><span begin="01:50.320" end="01:51.040">searching </span><span begin="01:51.040" end="01:51.250">in </span><span begin="01:51.250" end="01:51.610">my </span><span begin="01:51.610" end="01:52.360">head</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.390" end="01:55.150"><span begin="01:52.390" end="01:52.690">For </span><span begin="01:52.690" end="01:52.930">the </span><span begin="01:52.930" end="01:53.440">words </span><span begin="01:53.440" end="01:53.620">I </span><span begin="01:53.620" end="01:53.980">thought </span><span begin="01:53.980" end="01:54.280">she </span><span begin="01:54.280" end="01:55.150">said</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.180" end="01:56.620"><span begin="01:55.180" end="01:55.510">For </span><span begin="01:55.510" end="01:56.080">too </span><span begin="01:56.080" end="01:56.620">loooooong</span><span begin="01:56.620" end="01:56.620">.</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.620" end="02:01.000"><span begin="01:56.620" end="01:59.950">I </span><span begin="01:59.950" end="02:00.370">feel </span><span begin="02:00.370" end="02:01.000">her</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.150" end="02:05.320"><span begin="02:01.150" end="02:02.410">Slipping </span><span begin="02:02.410" end="02:03.160">through </span><span begin="02:03.160" end="02:03.760">my </span><span begin="02:03.760" end="02:05.320">fingers</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.440" end="02:12.100"><span begin="02:05.440" end="02:05.800">Now </span><span begin="02:05.800" end="02:06.610">she's </span><span begin="02:06.610" end="02:07.660">gone</span><span begin="02:07.660" end="02:07.960">, </span><span begin="02:07.960" end="02:08.230">I'm </span><span begin="02:08.230" end="02:09.010">sleeping </span><span begin="02:09.010" end="02:09.430">with </span><span begin="02:09.430" end="02:09.520">the </span><span begin="02:09.520" end="02:10.180">light </span><span begin="02:10.180" end="0